<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Belovéd, draw me nearer still,</l><l>To enjoy You intimately;</l><l>My heart, my all is Yours to fill,</l><l>To transform, mature utterly.</l><l>May my life express Your righteousness;</l><l>Satisfying and matching Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The corporate bride, God’s heart’s desire;</l><l>We give all and race desperately;</l><l>From individualism freed,</l><l>Members, build in love mut’ually;</l><l>Each one functioning and blended,</l><l>Give Him glory in unity.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Bride-warrior, armored, stands arrayed,</l><l>Will submissive, God’s to obey;</l><l>A fearsome army, one with God;</l><l>At her banners, foes flee away;</l><l>More than conqu’rors, spread to all the earth,</l><l>Build God’s kingdom, and turn the age.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
